nd it could be  enhanced with a few small tweaks in the  end I suppose inspector O'Hara is right  we can't ever know how many lives have  been saved or attacks prevented by the  DDA we would put to sleep probably  around 300 dogs this year no I have to  sort of draw the inference here that  they're not necessarily all healthy dogs  or safe dogs to have our own people far  from it in fact and what I can say is we  have rehomed around 56 dogs this year so  far and we won't destroy a dog without  some kind of a paper trail so a  disclaimer when the dog can't lawfully  be rehomed a court order that says it  must be destroyed but if a court rules  that a dog is not a danger to public  safety and the owner is a fit and proper  person then nine times out of ten that  dog will go on  Daniel Howard has begun a six-month jail  term after he pleaded guilty to 17  offences eight of his dogs have been  destroyed  this one has been rehomed  akaash became a firm favorite with  kennel staff but never recovered and had  to be put down  after more than 38 years service  sergeant Peter Madden has retired from  the force for a civilian job he's still  working with dogs there will be a  variety of reasons why dog will bite man  often it will be something that man has  done dogs are man's best friend I would  question whether man is dog's best  friend the attack on Carla happened two  years ago duster and Tony have only  spoken now in the hope that what  happened then to their little girl will  never happen to another child again  Lucas still crosses the road whenever he  sees a dog but the trauma of witnessing  the attack and his little sister is  fading carla continues to astound her  parents and everybody else with her  courage what if her friends asked me the  other day you know when's Carles car  gonna go you know just as a aside and  it's like well you know what it's never  gonna go you know people especially  still I've always have a scarf but it  will fade and it will fade more and more  she's rebuilding her young life smile my  beautiful smile
 

